I've compied the tests from this PR https://github.com/fastify/fastify/pull/5009.
I think the main idea of them is that when you create a regular `GET` route, fastify creates a `HEAD` route automatically. Then when you create another `GET` route, fastify looks for a `HEAD` route before creating a new one. So you test `HEAD` routes indirectly.

